=== apogee execute
--- stdin
hi
--- exit 1
--- stdout
--- stderr
apogee execute: execute opens a session with a suite, and none is named or the default -- run one with --suite <name> (configured: duo, fast, strict), or make one the default: apogee config set-default-suite <name>
=== apogee execute --suite off
--- stdin
hi
--- exit 1
--- stdout
--- stderr
apogee execute: --suite off names no suite, and execute opens a session with one -- 'apogee chat --suite off' is a session without
